\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-l3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Provider-neutral Messages-wire stream layer[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wire[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire: generalize the Claude stream-json parser into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provider-parameterized Anthropic-Messages reader — runtime tagging, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`errors[]` diagnostics, a thinking-block sink, and a pluggable tool-call[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer seam — leaving Claude behavior byte-identical.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Grok tool-call normalizer[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tools[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tools: add `_tool_call_grok.py` mapping Grok's snake_case tool names and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON-string tool_result envelopes onto SASE's canonical display names [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and structured summaries so ACE Tools rows show real commands and paths.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The grok provider module[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]provider[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tools[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]provider: add `src/sase/llm_provider/grok.py` and its `sase_llm` entry [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]point — hooks, tier/model mapping, the verified four-level effort table,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the invocation vector, the interrupt/continue loop, and unit tests over [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recorded fixtures.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Doctor, inventory, and binary-collision s